            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "BP to sell 65% of Castrol stake, Sanofi's $2.2B deal for Dynavax",
            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance executive editor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/brian-sozzi/\">Brian Sozzi</a> tracks several of the day's top trending stock tickers, including BP (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BP\">BP</a>) selling 65% of its stake in Castrol automotive lubricant business to Stonepeak, Sanofi (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SNY\">SNY</a>) agreeing to acquire hepatitis B vaccine maker Dynavax Technologies (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/DVAX\">DVAX</a>) in a $2.2 billion deal, and UiPath (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PATH\">PATH</a>) is scheduled to begin trading on the S&P Midcap 400 index (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5ESP400\">^SP400</a>).</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/morning-brief/\">Morning Brief</a>.</p>",
